tinacloud-project-update-protected-branch-remove(1) -- Remove a protected branch
================================================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Remove a protected branch from the given project.

This command is only available if your project has access to the editorial
workflow feature.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project update protected-branch remove`

## OPTIONS

  * `--branch`:
    A protected branch

  * `--org-id`:
    TinaCloud organization ID

  * `--project-id`:
    TinaCloud project ID

  * `--tina-dir`:
    Path to the tina folder (default "tina")

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud project update protected-branch remove \
		--branch "main" \
		--branch "develop"

